    "not_ordinary_type_only_cleanup": true
  },
  "decision": "The complete original select patch deletes a positive aria-autocomplete=none assertion from the modern combobox role test; it does not fix an implementation. The current owned legacy role test already has the stronger explicit negative assertion that aria-autocomplete is absent. Retain that assertion, the role and haspopup checks, and all production source. The untouched Material16 test expected none; the existing owned production adaptation60776637ee78cd942a3527402e3e8f9f25d871c1 changed that contract earlier and requires its own full accessibility/behavior review. This test-only source decision does not reapprove that separate adaptation, claim an inherited peer fix, or qualify actual browser accessibility.",
